/target
*.log

# Runtime shader-compiler cache: the engine writes this to `./Shaders/.cache` (relative to cwd)
# the first time a `sturdy`-based binary compiles a shader at runtime — pure build output, not
# source (the engine's own `.slang` shaders ship embedded in the compiled binary via CMake; see
# `Core::Slang::find_embedded_shader` in the vendored engine).
/Shaders/

# The SturdyEngine5 C++ engine source is owned by the engine's own repository, not this one. It is
# expected at `sturdy-sys/vendor/sturdyengine5` (copy, symlink, or submodule) — see README.md
# "Building". `build.rs` fails with instructions if it is missing.
/sturdy-sys/vendor/sturdyengine5/

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
